{"2448730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Swords and Hexes", "steam_appid": 2448730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Swords and Hexes&quot; </strong>a top-down strategy-RPG adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the wacky world, top-down, feet up, frolicking through the enchanted land. Tittle-tattle with its dwellers, explore, collect, upgrade, strategize and hex-and-slash your foes all while resisting the hero’s journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’re a scruffy servant  </strong>who’s gotten into a bit of a pickle while running errands for the dainty <strong>Prince Charles</strong>, for he is the one saviour who will crush the dark forces that loom <i>(naturally)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traversing through the picturesque land of <strong>Hexagonia</strong>, you'll cross paths with its many residents from the lake monster <strong>Bessy</strong>, to the <strong>Maiden Painter</strong>, and the <strong>Troll Brothers</strong>. Choose your allies wisely, or you may end up woven in a mess between industrious beavers and tree hugging squirrelies, and oh boy do we all know how that fable goes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hex</strong> <strong>or smash your foes, in a style of your choosing, through Hex-and-Slash Combat </strong>with a plethora of options, like weapons, gemstones, scrolls, abilities, the environment itself, and an occasional sandwich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fun <strong>do-abouts</strong> like mining, fishing, hog riding <i>(our favourite) </i>you will be <strong>collecting shoddy and peculiar items</strong> for yourself and for the whole family. (<i>Even grandma is enjoying herself!)</i> So if you like returning pans to old ladies, or learning about wildlife, this one’s for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragra