 mining, fishing, hog riding <i>(our favourite) </i>you will be <strong>collecting shoddy and peculiar items</strong> for yourself and for the whole family. (<i>Even grandma is enjoying herself!)</i> So if you like returning pans to old ladies, or learning about wildlife, this one’s for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448730/extras/5087a92043610b0f07be111ceae7128f.poster.avif?t=1778591894\" width=410 height=307 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448730/extras/5087a92043610b0f07be111ceae7128f.webm?t=1778591894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "&quot;Swords &amp; Hexes&quot; is an action RPG adventure! Where a scruffy serf and his freaky dog try to resist the heroes journey in a hex-obsessed world, be it by their own might, or perchance magic.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448730/03913228c8f3bdce0cee16fa681e16dbd9ce8838/header.jpg?t=1778591894", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448730/86d95ba76edf685b0ce8e13deb0519aae42e5391/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778591894", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448730/86d95ba76edf685b0ce8e13deb0519aae42e5391/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778591894", "website": "https://studiobedem.rs", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> 64-bit Windows 7, Windows 8.1, Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4430 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB 